{
  "job_B9.1.2_20251003_114914": {
    "text": "\u00d0\u00e6tte unl\u00e6rede ne dyrren underfon lariowdom.\nNe eft \u00f0a gel\u00e6redan, \u00f0e sua nylla\u00f0 libban sua hie on bocum leornedon, \u00f0\u00e6t hie sceoldon ne underfon \u00f0a\nBe \u00f0\u00e6re byr\u00f0enne \u00f0\u00e6s reccenddomes, & hu he scyle eall earfo\u00f0u forsion, & hu forht he sceal bion for\nOnd hu oft sio bisgung \u00f0\u00e6s rices & \u00f0\u00e6s recedomes toslit \u00f0\u00e6t mod \u00f0\u00e6s recceres.\nBi \u00f0\u00e6m \u00f0e magon on ealdordome nytte bion on bisnum & on cr\u00e6ftum, & \u00f0onne for hiora agenre\nBi \u00f0am \u00f0e for ea\u00f0modnesse fleo\u00f0 \u00f0a byr\u00f0enne \u00f0\u00e6s lariowdomes;\n\u00d0onne hie bio\u00f0 ryhtlice ea\u00f0mode \u00f0onne hie ne winna\u00f0 wi\u00f0 \u00f0one godcundan dom.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte oft \u00f0\u00e6s lariowdomes \u00f0egnung bi\u00f0 sui\u00f0e unt\u00e6lwier\u00f0lice gewilnad, & eac sui\u00f0e unt\u00e6lwyr\u00f0lice\nBi \u00f0\u00e6m \u00f0e wilna\u00f0 biscephad to underfonne, hu hie gegripa\u00f0 \u00f0one cuide \u00f0\u00e6s apostoles Paules hira\nHu \u00f0\u00e6t mod \u00f0\u00e6tte wilna\u00f0 for o\u00f0re bion, lih\u00f0 himselfum \u00f0onne hit \u00f0enc\u00f0 fela godra weorca to wyrcanne,\nHuelc se beon sceal \u00f0e to reccenddome cuman sceal.\nHuelc se beon sceal se \u00f0\u00e6rto cuman ne sceal.\nHu se se \u00f0e gedafenlice & endebyrdlice to cym\u00f0, hu he \u00f0\u00e6ron drohtian scyle.\nHu se lareow sceal beon cl\u00e6ne on his mode.\nHu se lariow sceal beon on his weorcum fyrmes\u00f0.\nHu se lariow sceal beon gesceadwis on his suigean & nyttwyr\u00f0e on his wordum.\nHu se lariow sceal bion eallum monnum efn\u00f0rowiende & fore\u00f0encende on hira earfe\u00f0um.\nHu se reccere sceal bion \u00f0\u00e6m weldoendum monnum fore ea\u00f0modnesse gefera, & wi\u00f0 \u00f0ara yfelena\nHu se lariow ne sceal \u00f0a inneran gimenne gewanian for \u00f0\u00e6re, uterran abisgunge, ne eft \u00f0a uterran ne\n\u00d0\u00e6tte se reccere his godan weorc fore gielpe anum ne do, ac ma for Godes lufan.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte se reccere sceal geornlice witan \u00f0\u00e6tte oft \u00f0a un\u00f0eawas leoga\u00f0 & licetta\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6tte hi sien gode\nHu gesceadwis se reccere sceal bion on his \u00f0reaunga & on his oleccunga, & eac on his hatheortnesse &\nHu sui\u00f0e se reccere sceal bion on his smeaunga abisgod ymb \u00f0a halgan \u00e6.\nHu micel scyle bion \u00f0\u00e6t toscead, & hu mislice mon scyle men l\u00e6ran mid \u00f0\u00e6m cr\u00e6fte \u00f0\u00e6s\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to manianne weras, on o\u00f0re wiif.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to manianne \u00f0a iungan, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a ealdan.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to manianne \u00f0a welegan, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a w\u00e6dlan.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to manianne \u00f0a gladan, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a unrotan.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a aldormen, on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a hiremen.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a hlafordas, on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0egnas & eac \u00f0a \u00f0eowas.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a dolan, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a wisan.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a scamf\u00e6stan, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a scamleasan.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a ofermodan & \u00f0a upahafenan on hira mode, on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a unge\u00f0yl\u00f0egan, & on o\u00f0re \u00f0a ge\u00f0yldegan.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to moniane \u00f0a welwillendan, & on o\u00f0re \u00f0a \u00e6fstegan.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a bilwitan, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a \u00f0weoran & \u00f0a lytegan.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a halan, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a unhalan.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a \u00f0e him ondr\u00e6da\u00f0 Godes suingellan o\u00f0\u00f0e monna, & for \u00f0y\nOn o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e bio\u00f0 sua aheardode on unryhtwisnesse \u00f0\u00e6t hi mon ne m\u00e6g mid nanre \u00f0reaunge\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a \u00f0e to sui\u00f0e suige beo\u00f0, on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e willa\u00f0 to fela idles\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a \u00f0e bio\u00f0 to late, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a \u00f0e bio\u00f0 to hrade.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a mon\u00f0w\u00e6ran, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a gramb\u00e6ran.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a ea\u00f0modan, on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a uppah\u00e6fenan on hira mode.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a anwillan, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a ungest\u00e6\u00f0\u00f0egan & unf\u00e6s\u00f0r\u00e6dan.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a \u00f0e hi selfe forgiefa\u00f0 gifernesse, on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e do\u00f0\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a \u00f0e hira agenu \u00f0ing mildheortlice sella\u00f0, & on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a \u00f0e nohu\u00e6\u00f0er ne o\u00f0ra monna ne wilnia\u00f0, ne hira agen nylla\u00f0\nOn o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e willa\u00f0 sellan \u00f0\u00e6t hi gestrina\u00f0 & \u00f0eah nylla\u00f0 geswican \u00f0\u00e6t hi o\u00f0re men ne reafien.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a ge\u00f0w\u00e6ran, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a unge\u00f0w\u00e6ran.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a wrohtgeornan, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a gesibsuman.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to moniane \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00f0a halgan \u00e6 ryhtlice ongitan ne cunnan;\nOn o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e hi ryhtlice angieta\u00f0 & \u00f0eah for ea\u00f0modnesse swigia\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t hi hie ne bodiat.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a \u00f0e medomlice cunnon l\u00e6ran, & \u00f0eah for miclum ege & for\n& on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00f0anne giet to \u00f0\u00e6m gewintrede ne beo\u00f0 ne ge\u00f0igene, & \u00f0eah for hr\u00e6dhydignesse\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a \u00f0e woroldare wilnia\u00f0, & hi \u00f0onne orsorglice habba\u00f0;\n& on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e woroldare wilnia\u00f0, & \u00f0onne hi gewilnode habba\u00f0, hi \u00f0onne mid micelre\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a \u00f0e beo\u00f0 gebundene mid somr\u00e6denne, on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a \u00f0e gefandod habba\u00f0 \u00f0ara fl\u00e6sclicra synna, on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to moniane \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00f0a geworhtan synna wepa\u00f0, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00f0a ge\u00f0ohtan\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00f0urhtogena scylda wepa\u00f0, & hi sua\u00f0eah ne forl\u00e6ta\u00f0;\nOn o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e hi no ne hreowsia\u00f0, & \u00f0eah forl\u00e6ta\u00f0.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00f0a unaliefedan \u00f0ing \u00f0a \u00f0e hi do\u00f0 herigea\u00f0, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a \u00f0e hi\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a \u00f0e sui\u00f0e hr\u00e6dlice beo\u00f0 ofersui\u00f0de mid sumere unryhtre\nOn o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e longe \u00e6r ymb\u00f0eahtia\u00f0, & hit \u00f0onne on las\u00f0 \u00f0urhteo\u00f0.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a \u00f0e ofthr\u00e6dlice lytla scylda wyrcea\u00f0, on o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e hi\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a \u00f0e nan wuht godes ne onginna\u00f0;\nOn o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e hit onginna\u00f0, & wel ne geendia\u00f0.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to monianne \u00f0a \u00f0e deogollice yfel do\u00f0 & god openlice;\nOn o\u00f0re wisan \u00f0a \u00f0e willa\u00f0 helan \u00f0\u00e6t hi to gode do\u00f0, & of sumum \u00f0ingum openlice ky\u00f0a\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t hi\nYmbe \u00f0\u00e6t hu man monige scyndan scyle to \u00f0\u00e6m \u00f0\u00e6tte his godan d\u00e6da ne weor\u00f0en to yfelum d\u00e6dum.\nYmbe \u00f0\u00e6t hu mon \u00e6nne mon scyndan scile \u00f0onne he yfle costunga monige \u00f0rowa\u00f0.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte hwilum \u00f0a leohtan scylda beo\u00f0 beteran to forl\u00e6tan, \u00f0yl\u00e6s \u00f0a hefegran ne weor\u00f0en \u00f0urhtogen.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte \u00f0a untruman mod mon ne scyle eallinga to helice l\u00e6ran.\nBe \u00f0\u00e6m weorcum \u00f0\u00e6s lareowes & be his wordum.\n\u00d0onne hwa \u00f0is eall gefylled h\u00e6bbe, hu he \u00f0onne sceal hine selfne ge\u00f0encean & ong\u00e6tan, \u00f0yl\u00e6s hine",
